    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d647">

                <pb facs="0784" n="688" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg688"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to the
                            Duke de Arcos.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-09-18"><hi rendition="#italic">September 18,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to your personal letter 11th relative Spanish prisoners, Secretary War
                    has cabled General Otis to give every facility to Spanish commissioners for the
                    care of released prisoners.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
